Root cause:
The bug was caused by an incorrect calculation of the offset for the bootloader name, which did not account for the length of the command lines for the modules. This oversight led to a situation where part of a module's command line was overwritten by the bootloader name string. The patch resolves this issue by accurately calculating the total size required for the command lines before determining the position of the bootloader name.
